Upstream-Status: Inappropriate Custom board patch, not suitable for upstreaming

If no explicit -a angle is given, query the DRM "panel orientation" property
from the DRM device corresponding to the fbdev in use. Resolve the DRM card
from /sys/class/graphics/fb<N>/device/drm instead of assuming the fbdev index
matches the DRM card index.

The DRM "panel orientation" property is a standard kernel connector property
set from the "rotation" device-tree binding (via of_drm_get_panel_orientation).
Enum values: "Normal"=0 deg, "Upside Down"=180 deg,
             "Left Side Up"=90 deg, "Right Side Up"=270 deg.

Signed-off-by: Boris Krasnovskiy <boris.krasnovskiy@ezurio.com>
---
